au Vadh story wonderfully... I am reading Shri Valmiki Ramayan daily in morning and coincidentally this reel came on my phone's screen. As I read same explained in this story by you,  the 10 arms of Ravan, Mules in place of horses, breaking down of bow and at last he attacked with his Sword and flew to Lanka 👏🔥🔥 just carry on.", "timestamp": 1792677368, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "ishwarya__amin", "author_id": "3842688572", "id": "18462987706184237", "text": "Udupi", "timestamp": 1792427930, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "vijayalakshmi_.manga", "author_id": "65961766622", "id": "18113731406032068", "text": "Le pakshi", "timestamp": 1792394567, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chickenplayingpiano_", "author_id": "58538914622", "id": "18091564406206662", "text": "Amazing and unique style of presenting a story, 👏🙌 Love your works, ❤️❤️", "timestamp": 1792254585, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "dvcb49mm", "author_id": "57818821141", "id": "18098439152533480", "text": "Why is this story different every time. Some say something while the others say something else.", "timestamp": 1792249036, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "deviloolived", "author_id": "17806952210", "id": "18137080324653791", "text": "Our place jadayu fallen, chadayamangalam, old name jadayumangalam", "timestamp": 1792233961, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "funinlife2025", "author_id": "72693079224", "id": "18097346693546909", "text": "There is a place called Mahendra giri , where jatayu brother lived., Tiru-nel-veli Tamilnadu \n\nAlso Jatayu Theerta at Tiru-nel-veli where Rama did last rights to Jatayu\n\nAlso Jatayu samadhi at vaitheswaran Kovil near Kumbakonam", "timestamp": 1792216503, "like_count": 31}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DejfaiRRGZd/", "webpage_url_basename": "DejfaiRRGZd", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/851829349_18126068398755882_274961640606443467_n.